WEBVTT

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.400
So, Hannibal and Charlemagne both...

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:11.740
Indeed. The Destroyer-King of
 the East cannot be underestimated.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:15.110
Cesare, you were near when it happened.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.380
Did you just stand 
back and let this happen?

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.800
Of course not. I rushed
 to my brothers' aid as soon

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.470
I learned they were in danger,

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.090
but I was too late.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.080
I can only offer my regret.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:33.800
In any case,
 we have lost two of the Chosen.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.430
This is a significant setback.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.990
The end is near.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:44.440
We must summon twelve Chosen
 here in order to protect this star.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:47.710
Regarding that, Your Majesty.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.410
If we use the prophet woman wisely,

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.830
we may be able to
 achieve our long-awaited goal.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.480
I had no idea our maiden voyage into space

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:38.240
would turn into a rescue 
mission for Jeanne-chan.

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:41.590
So this is the sea of stars.

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:44.540
What's the matter?

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.290
It's so vast.

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:48.960
I feel like I could lose myself in it.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:54.340
To rule heaven and earth
 means ruling an entire star.

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.940
And for that, I need Ranmaru's power.

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:01.910
Are you sure you don't mean 
that you need Ranmaru, herself?

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:05.100
My betrothed...

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:22.010
Please don't look at me like that.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:24.330
It makes me want to toy with you more.

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:34.540
I merely want you to lend us your power.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:37.570
The power even da Vinci acknowledged...

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.620
There is a tale told on this star

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.400
which says that when we face destruction,

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.550
one who can hear the voice of God will appear

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:58.460
and use that power
 to seek out the Savior-King.

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:01.740
Yes, you are the one who seeks out,

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:04.630
Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc.

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.010
Your words carry great weight.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:14.180
Whoever you choose will be the Savior-King.

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:17.490
So I ask only for a
 loud and clear declaration.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:23.560
I want you to declare that our liege,
 King Arthur, is the Savior-King.

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:29.330
Your words will be
 understood as the truth,

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:32.340
and everyone on this
 star will believe them.

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:36.100
They will believe in
 King Arthur, the Savior-King!

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:40.620
Their faith will awaken 
the people's latent powers

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:43.360
and, over time, bring the Chosen here!

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:48.600
True Chosen who will not be overcome 
by the likes of the Destroyer-King.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.460
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:52.590
I refuse to help you people!

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.660
Arthur is not the Savior-King!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.630
The vision has shown me...

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:00.560
...that the Savior-King is 
on the Star of the East!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.030
That's hardly relevant.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.130
What?

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.690
What's important are the words you,

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:10.140
the prophet, will speak.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:14.410
Once you speak King Arthur's name,
 it will become truth.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.630
Ridiculous!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:17.050
Who would agree to that?!

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:21.920
So you won't cooperate?

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:23.950
This is most unfortunate.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:29.010
I truly did not wish to see your 
beautiful face cut into pieces,

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.210
your skin flayed off,

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:33.030
and your bones exposed...

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.740
But I suppose it is unavoidable.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:40.220
Not only do you refuse to 
accept our Savior-King,

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:42.970
but you are a heathen
 masquerading as a man.

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:47.340
We have no choice but to mete
 out an appropriate punishment.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:51.340
I... will not submit to the likes of you!

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.430
How brave.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.660
Machiavelli?

00:05:58.660 --> 00:05:59.900
What do you want?

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:03.360
Why not let me handle the girl?

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:04.370
Oh?

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.630
Mere physical suffering will not work.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:11.390
Girls like her need mental anguish.

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:28.980
This place!

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:31.800
Well?

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:34.540
How do you feel about
 returning to your birthplace?

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.500
Hey, that's...

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:44.040
Why did she come back?

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.090
No!

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:50.910
How terrible.

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:54.440
Even though you're one of their own,

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:57.100
no one's trying to help you.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:05.920
Let go!

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.850
Why us?

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:08.920
Dorée, stop!

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:13.830
Gilles...

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.230
Dorée...

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.080
Everyone!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.910
I hear that you were her friends.

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:28.620
What was she like before?

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:30.720
Please, can you tell me?

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.180
She was scary...

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:36.670
What? I can't hear you.

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.090
Say it one more time.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:40.630
Jeanne was scary!

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:44.630
Everyone said... Jeanne brings misfortune.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:45.830
That's not true, Dorée!

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:47.120
What's not true?

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:51.600
You tried to kill us when we 
were playing on the bridge, too!

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:52.910
No!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.210
I was trying to save everyone!

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.110
There it starts.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.290
Not again.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.590
How ominous!

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:02.380
What will happen?

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:09.220
This is...

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.000
Just a while ago,

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.140
the Wings of Guidance began to tremor 
repeatedly in the most ominous way.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.520
Everyone says

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:19.830
it's as though the
 ground itself is screaming.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:22.460
And now you're back.

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:25.010
Everyone's more afraid than ever!

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:27.110
They think you brought misfortune!

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:29.100
Why...?

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.530
Because

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:32.740
you're the devil's spawn.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.240
Don't bother us anymore!

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:37.750
You devil!

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:48.260
No one here is your ally.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.600
Not even your parents live here now.

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.060
What do you mean?

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.790
After you departed from this star,

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:58.600
they were exiled from the village

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.210
as the loathsome ones
 who gave birth to a demon.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.150
How sad.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.780
They had done nothing wrong,

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:10.000
but they were robbed of their home.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.620
I'm sure your parents are wondering...

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.620
...why they gave birth to a girl like you.

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:22.320
Maybe that you shouldn't have been born.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:25.750
That you shouldn't have 
ever been born, Jeanne.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.130
Stop!

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.500
You will be reviled and
 spurned for the rest of your life.

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:35.520
"The devil's spawn."

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:38.310
"Don't go near her! She'll curse you."

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:41.200
But...

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:45.870
There is just one way for
 you to be saved from all this.

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:49.890
Acknowledge King Arthur as the Savior-King,

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:52.350
and become his wife.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:54.130
What?

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:57.040
Then you'll be the Savior-King's wife.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:02.610
Who could bear malice against the 
wife of the hero who will save our star?

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:07.530
You will be saved from everyone,
 and become loved

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:10.020
as the consort of the Savior-King.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:10.840
No!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.290
You need only acknowledge
 King Arthur as the Savior-King.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:18.110
You don't want to be despised, do you?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.900
You suffer because of
 their hate, don't you?

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:24.630
You can change your life.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:31.390
I...

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:36.030
I cannot do that!

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:37.380
Wha?

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:42.850
I already believe

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.610
that <i>he</i> alone can be the Savior-King.

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:50.110
I don't need to change my life.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.140
Even if I still suffer,

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:55.080
I do not want to lie to myself!

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:57.050
I see.

00:10:57.230 --> 00:11:00.170
Then I suppose I have no choice.

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:13.470
Oh?

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:17.610
It's Donremy village, Jeanne's birthplace.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:21.740
So that's where Ranmaru is.

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:28.850
But, why did they go through
 the trouble of returning her there?

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:31.630
Well, let's get down there!

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:32.840
Don't be so rash.

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:36.260
In a way, this entire 
star is enemy territory.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.390
Now that we lack The Fool,

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:41.360
we should devise a careful 
strategy before doing anything.

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:44.270
Are you sure you can
 afford to take your sweet time?

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:46.270
You found something?

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.320
Sorry.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:57.700
We overheard that

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:01.680
Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc's execution 
will take place tomorrow morning.

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:02.950
What?!

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:10.700
The Hanged Man, reversed...

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.640
Execute Jeanne?

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:25.070
That's going too far.

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:26.680
But she's possessed, isn't she?

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:29.160
Is it our fault?

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.090
Is it because we said 
bad things about Jeanne?

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:33.080
That's not true!

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:38.090
I mean...
 We just spoke the truth!

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:41.060
You there!

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:48.330
Go to the plaza and watch
 Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc's execution!

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:53.880
How terrible.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:58.740
Apparently everyone can't wait to 
see you go up in flames.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:03.790
Jeanne...

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:07.630
Cesare has told me not to kill you.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:12.250
It seems he is intent 
on obtaining your power.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:17.010
But don't worry, after you die,

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:18.860
I will...

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.450
inherit your power.

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:23.870
That's not poss...

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:27.870
Whether it's possible or not is irrelevant.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.630
I can just say that I did.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:34.360
"Ah, I can hear voices from Heaven!"

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:38.460
"I must have been chosen anew."

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.720
That's despicable...

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:43.250
I didn't bring you all the 
way here to a village in the

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:45.880
middle of nowhere just to make you suffer.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:50.360
It's also because I cannot 
kill you under Cesare's watch.

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:53.940
I will become the
 chosen one in your stead.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:58.370
Then the Regalia will accept me, I'm sure.

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.090
Foolish girl.

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:08.530
If only you had accepted my offer,

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.010
you wouldn't have had to die,

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:12.960
and you would have been 
accepted by these people.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:16.020
It is true that I wanted to be accepted,

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.750
but that is as a human being!

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:23.530
I don't want wed a false Savior-King!

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:26.890
I want to be accepted for my own worth,

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:28.530
as a human being!

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:31.670
What is she talking about?

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:42.600
This is...

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:44.850
Everyone, run!

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:46.590
This village will...

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:49.410
What, a vision?

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.520
It's the Devil's prophecy!

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:56.650
Run!

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:59.030
The Devil is trying to destroy the village!

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:59.250
Hey, wait! Bastards!

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:04.250
Mist?

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:05.930
Lady Machiavelli!

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:07.160
What's the matter?!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.360
Look!

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:11.060
Our defense line has been broken!

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.250
In the mist, they—

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:22.570
We have word of an enemy
 attack southwest of the village!

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:23.920
Stay on alert!

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:25.350
It's no use.

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:26.780
We can't see anything!

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:39.030
We lost contact with two 
units guarding the north!

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:40.990
The enemy is attacking from two sides.

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:42.780
Concentrate our men there!

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:45.640
What is going on?

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.180
What is this mist?!

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.780
So you used the Regalia of earth

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:57.850
to make the ground resonate, 
and caused mist to rise.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.670
An impressive technique.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:04.260
This will force the enemy to focus 
their men on the areas being attacked,

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:08.600
which will create a path.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.000
I would not want to win without a fight.

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:16.970
Go save Ranmaru, my betrothed.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.170
Here I come!

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:22.650
A wing-horse?!

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:23.480
Who is that?

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:25.090
It can't be...

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:27.060
What are you doing?!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:28.070
Stop him!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:40.390
What?!

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:55.120
What's the matter?

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:57.020
Stop looking like such a girl,

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.580
Ranmaru!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.720
Nobunaga!

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:02.530
The Destroyer-King...

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.810
If you come any closer...

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:23.990
The reports were correct.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.520
So you've voyaged 
to this star after all,

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:28.280
Destroyer-King.

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.090
The village vermin

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:34.640
will be more than honored
 to serve King Arthur and myself

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:36.350
with their lives.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:39.720
You as well, Machiavelli.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:41.520
Go in, now!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.460
Get Nobunaga out of there!

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:44.820
We can't!

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:47.760
The ley lines are unstable!
 We can't fly outside of this valley!

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:51.100
The dragon...

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:55.000
The dragon of this star is weeping.

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:58.140
Himiko-sama...

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:04.950
Where is everyone?!

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:08.520
No!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.320
I don't want to die!

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:17.340
Nobunaga!

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.330
I see.

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:23.830
It is inevitable.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:34.810
Give me...

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:37.720
strength!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:47.140
What?!

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:51.970
It's... protecting us?

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:58.120
The flames are too strong!

00:18:58.750 --> 00:18:59.850
No...

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.140
I can't let people die again.

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:03.510
Not again!

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:04.970
Ranmaru?!

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:10.560
I <i>will</i> protect them!

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:13.820
Wh-What is that?!

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:15.690
That's...

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:17.110
Jeanne?!

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:22.120
They may despise me and hate me,

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.830
but I...

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:26.720
I...!

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:29.130
Jeanne...

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.570
I want to live as a human being!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:40.640
So the girl has reached ascension.

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:43.990
Let us begin.

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:48.600
Well done.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:52.190
Enough, Destroyer-King!

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:58.560
I don't recall taking such a name.

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:02.570
Who else could you be but the Destroyer-King

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:05.140
when you seek to obstruct 
King Arthur's plans?

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.340
Lady Machiavelli,
 your wounds must be tended.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:11.690
So glad I could come
 here in time, Machiavelli.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.860
I should be grateful for the good 
fortune that allowed me to save you.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.240
Well then, I would have 
you hand over that girl.

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:23.220
The prophecy belongs to the Savior-King.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:24.450
I refuse.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:27.780
I don't give a damn about the prophecy,

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:29.730
but Ranmaru is my retainer.

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:32.490
I won't hand her over to anyone else!

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:33.860
Nobunaga...

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.760
Then let's settle this right here.

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:41.100
What is the meaning of this?

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:43.250
We won't let you have Jeanne!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.370
She's one of us!

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:47.340
Gilles...

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:53.550
Remember how there's a cave up 
ahead where we used to play?

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.380
Use that to get out of here.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:56.620
Dorée...

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:58.280
My thanks.

00:20:58.840 --> 00:20:59.490
Onikage!

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:04.830
Let's go.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.990
Don't look at us like that.

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:11.000
We don't expect this is enough 
to make up for everything we did.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:11.730
Go!

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:16.870
<i>Dorée...</i>

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.050
<i>Gilles...</i>

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:19.470
<i>Everyone...!</i>

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:24.510
No!

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:28.750
What is going on?!

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:30.320
What the?

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:31.120
Again?

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.230
Why?!

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:40.800
Retreat!

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:42.660
So this

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:44.930
is the Devil's power...

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:47.800
H-Help...

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:49.080
No!

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:50.440
Help us!

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:51.420
No!

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:52.440
Everyone!

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:56.490
Gilles!

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:04.440
<i>Jeanne... I'm so... sorry...</i>

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:10.130
No!

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:31.730
What was that just now?

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:14.120
We are now isolated
 within the enemy's ranks.

00:24:14.780 --> 00:24:18.720
The annihilated village reveals 
a new secret behind the stars.

00:24:20.290 --> 00:24:22.420
Next time: Ace of Cups.

00:24:23.160 --> 00:24:24.480
Hurry, Mitsu!
